Environmental benefits of refurbishment are often intuitive but not quantified, reducing communication impact. Quantified environmental impact data overcomes skepticism about refurbishment sustainability claims. Clear environmental labelling appeals to growing consumer segments making purchasing decisions based on environmental impact.

Environmental impact data creates competitive advantage in markets where sustainability influences purchase decisions. Transparent environmental quantification prevents greenwashing accusations and builds credibility. Impact data demonstrates that refurbished products offer both economic and environmental benefits aligning incentives.